OL,3,GNEWSACharging e-scooter sparked fire in
OL,4,Aflat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire in a flat that took five crews
OL,7,Fmore than three hours to extinguish
OL,8,Fstarted when an e-scooter ignited while
OL,9,Fbeing charged.
OL,11,FTwo people were assessed by paramedics
OL,12,Ffor smoke inhalation after the blaze at
OL,13,FPatriot Place in Reading at about 14:30
OL,14,FBST on Tuesday.
OL,16,FA Royal Berkshire Fire and Rescue
OL,17,FService spokesperson said charging
OL,18,Fe-bikes and e-scooters indoors should
OL,19,Fbe avoided, particularly in communal
OL,20,Fareas.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
